  "en": {
    "kind": "Film music",
    "about": [
      "A 1966 Columbia album with six songs to lyrics by Nikos Gatsos - \"Matia vourkomena\", \"Stou Othona ta chronia\", \"Aspri mera kai gia mas\", \"O Lefteris\", \"Me ti kardia ton kosmo n' arnitho\" and \"I nychta\" - with instrumentals in between.",
      "According to Wikipedia, \"Matia vourkomena\", \"Stou Othona ta chronia\" and \"Me ti kardia (Apochairetismos)\" are heard in the film Diplopenies (1966), directed by Giorgos Skalenakis, for which Xarchakos wrote the music."
